# Keep the Vercel upload to source only — the build runs on Vercel (turbo, see apps/cloud/vercel.json).
#
# `vercel --prod` uploads the local WORKING DIRECTORY regardless of git
# tracking (unlike a git-push-triggered deploy) — unlike .gitignore, a
# missing entry here doesn't just skip a commit, it ships whatever's
# sitting on disk (secrets, real corpus data, PII) straight into the
# deploy artifact/source viewer. Round-3 review HIGH 18: this file used to
# drift from .gitignore — apps/cloud/scripts/spike-k89/output (real
# founder extraction output), apps/cloud/scripts/kg/prompt-lab/transcripts
# (real conversation exports), handoff_6_april_5.txt (a root-level session
# transcript, missed by the `handoff` entry below because it matches the
# `handoff/` DIRECTORY, not this sibling file), and MEMBRAL.md (sweep-
# generated session context) were all gitignored but NOT vercelignored, so
# a `vercel --prod` from a maintainer checkout would have shipped them.
#
# STRUCTURAL FIX: everything below the first section is copied VERBATIM
# from .gitignore (kept in the same order, one pattern per line) so the
# two files cannot silently diverge again — `scripts/check-vercelignore.sh`
# fails the build if a .gitignore pattern is ever missing here. Do not
# hand-edit this file out of sync with .gitignore; add to .gitignore first,
# then re-sync this section (or run check-vercelignore.sh -v to see the
# diff) and keep the Vercel-only build-artifact extras in the second
# section below.

# ============================================================
# Verbatim copy of every pattern in .gitignore (round-3 review HIGH 18) —
# checked by scripts/check-vercelignore.sh. The one negation (un-ignoring
# .claude/CONSTITUTION.md) is kept for fidelity with .gitignore's own
# semantics; it has no practical effect here since .claude is ALSO
# fully excluded below by the Vercel-only "**/.claude" entry (belt and
# suspenders — CONSTITUTION.md is governance text, not a secret, so this
# errs toward "ignored, not shipped" either way).
# ============================================================
node_modules/
dist/
.turbo/
.next/
out/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
coverage/
supabase/.temp/
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
private/
handoff*
MEMBRAL.md
AUDIT.md
SCAFFOLDING-DESIGN.md
.beads/
.claude/*
!.claude/CONSTITUTION.md
.opencode/
.omo/
PRD.md
LOCAL_DEV.md
screenshot.mjs
screenshot-auth.mjs
screenshot-search.mjs
debug.mjs
tools/
*.log
logs/
*.tsbuildinfo
packages/extension/dist/
~/.membral/
data/
apps/cloud/scripts/spike-k89/output/
eval-runs/
design/uploads/Screenshot 2026-06-16 at 5.12.09 PM.png
design/screens/01-map.png
design/screens/03-pulse.png
design/screens/03-v.png
design/screens/connected2.png
design/*.zip
design/.thumbnail
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
apps/cloud/scripts/kg/prompt-lab/transcripts/
apps/cloud/scripts/kg/prompt-lab/prompt.txt
.vercel
apps/cloud/public/downloads/*.zip
apps/cloud/public/downloads/manifest.json

# ============================================================
# Vercel-only extras (build artifacts / paths that were never in
# .gitignore because git never tracked them in the first place, or a
# belt-and-suspenders full-directory exclude for something .gitignore
# only partially excludes). check-vercelignore.sh does not require these
# to appear in .gitignore — this section is additive on top of the
# verbatim copy above.
# ============================================================
node_modules
.git
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/supabase/.temp
**/public/downloads
.beads
**/.claude
data
handoff
eval-runs
fixtures
design
membral_output
scratch
scratch*
*.log
*.jsonl
apps/cloud/scripts/spike-k89/output
apps/cloud/scripts/kg/prompt-lab/transcripts
